 "answer": "Release 0.34.3 extended the `GET /api/show` endpoint.\n\nThe release notes say: \"`GET /api/show` now advertises each model's thinking controls and default\" [ollama/v0.34.3.md].\n\nThe response includes a top-level `thinking` object with `values` and `default`. The release's own example request uses `curl` with a JSON body, and the Ollama thinking docs also show `/api/show` being called with a POST-style body containing the model name. The docs describe it this way: \"Use `/api/show` to discover the values a model supports and the value Ollama uses by default\" [ollama/docs/capabilities/thinking.md].",
